  (text "J1\nWHITE\ntrack" (at 44.0 38.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "J3\nBLACK\ntrack" (at 44.0 58.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "J5\nRED\ntrack" (at 44.0 78.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "J2\nWHITE\nctrl" (at 131.0 38.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "J4\nBLACK\nctrl" (at 131.0 58.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "J6\nRED\nctrl" (at 131.0 78.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "ALL CONNECTORS: 4mm banana sockets" (at 45.0 95.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "Track side (J1/J3/J5) connects to the three track banana sockets.\nController side (J2/J4/J6) the hand controller plugs into.\nModule is inserted between track and controller.\nDuring normal running the module is fully transparent.\nBrake detection by voltage sense on BLACK (J3/J4) terminal." (at 45.0 100.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "SIGNAL DESCRIPTIONS:\nWHITE (+12-16V):  Always-live rail from track PSU (40-90A capable)\n                  Powers module MCU via LDO on power supply sheet.\nBLACK (track +):  Controlled by hand controller (0 to rail voltage).\n                  Falls to near 0V when controller shorts for braking.\n                  Module monitors dV/dt for Latvian brake feature.\nRED (common -):   Left-hand braid return. Common ground reference." (at 45.0 115.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "BRAKE DETECTION (this module, not hand controller):\nV_BLACK < 500mV  => enter brake state\nV_BLACK > 1500mV => exit brake state\nHysteresis band prevents chatter at low throttle settings." (at 45.0 140.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "LATVIAN BRAKE (track call / emergency stop):\nMonitors WHITE dV/dt each 1ms tick.\nIf WHITE drops faster than SET LATVIAN_DVDT threshold,\nfires immediate dead short regardless of mode or pot.\nDefault: disabled (SET LATVIAN_DVDT 0).\nRecommended: SET LATVIAN_DVDT 1000 (1V/ms)." (at 45.0 158.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
)
